## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to integrate fetch, WebSocket, and a Service Worker into a cohesive, beginner-friendly flow. Emphasizes real-time UI updates, offline resilience, and robust error handling in a realistic frontend build.

## Key Concepts
- Fetch API, JSON rendering, minimal DOM diffing
- WebSocket lifecycle, message handling, reconnection strategies
- Service Worker lifecycle: install, activate, fetch event handling, cache strategies
- Backoff logic, race conditions, and offline UX

